{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","布莱恩"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名拥有超凡感知能力的魔法射手，能与魔法猎鹰共同作战。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我知道了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","很好，有所进步"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Good, that's some progress."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","去吧，伙伴"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Go, my friend."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","在所难免……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Gah... inevitable..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","做得很好"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Brilliantly done."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","有什么事？也许我的伙伴能帮上忙。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","（思考）嗯……（艾洛娜飞来，侧头，伸手接住）来得正好，艾洛娜（艾洛娜点头，侧头倾听，艾洛娜梳理羽毛）嗯……嗯，原来如此。（摸摸艾洛娜）知道了，谢谢你。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Well, just in time. Mm... mm, I see. Understood, thank you."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","（艾洛娜蹦跶飞起来）……嗯？怎么？（侧头看向艾洛娜，摸胸毛）做得很好。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","The wind has brought news—go."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","（手聚集魔法）风带来了新的消息……（挥手发出）去吧"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Huh, what's wrong? ...Well done."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","您很善于察觉别人的喜好，这是您的天赋之一。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我的荣幸。"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","巡羽林锋"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","在碧海的呼唤中。捕捉最细微的声音。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","碧沙星涌"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","碧沙涌动，星辉散落如织。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","限时礼包购买获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","在这里休息十分钟吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","没有消息就是好消息"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","艾洛娜，你饿了吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","艾洛娜很喜欢新的灯光"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","今夜也会落雪吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","匠心独运的装饰"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","今晚就由我巡视吧"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","布莱恩听觉灵敏，不喜欢嘈杂的环境，尤其不能忍受洛桑的喋喋不休。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","“呵，呵，布莱恩不喜欢对别人说起自己的事，如果你们刨根问底的话，他可能会装作没听到。”雅顿常对来找布莱恩的人这么说。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","布莱恩十分低调，在学生时代并不出色，大多数人不知道他被贤者雅顿选中的理由。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","和老师雅顿一样，布莱恩深居简出，比他的老师更加惜字如金。甚至有些人觉得他不会说话。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","艾洛娜并非布莱恩饲养的宠物。在布莱恩看来，是艾洛娜选择成为他的同伴，他对此深怀感激。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","布莱恩并非盲人，这一点除了他的老师鲜有人知晓。如果去问洛桑，他则会假装大吃一惊，然后露出得意的笑容。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","“那家伙小时候可吓人了，随便就能说中人家心里的事，简直就像有读心术一样。”布莱恩小时候的玩伴至今仍心有余悸。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","“我记得小时候没什么人敢跟他说话，只有丛林中的鸟兽陪伴他，后来，洛桑和莱卡开始和他搭话。”达赫妮婆婆这样回忆道。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","布莱恩的敏锐也许会让人疏远他，却让艾洛娜成了他忠实的同伴，他们一起出现的身影已经长达七年。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","很少有人知道，布莱恩能用口哨吹出非常美丽动听的曲调。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","在这里休息十分钟吧"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415104.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","布莱恩"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","艾洛娜，你饿了吗？"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415105.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","布莱恩"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","艾洛娜很喜欢新的灯光"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415413.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","布莱恩"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","今夜也会落雪吧"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415414.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","布莱恩"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","匠心独运的装饰"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415585.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","布莱恩"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","今晚就由我巡视吧"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415586.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","布莱恩"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","啊，真是麻烦……我讨厌工作。"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415700.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","沙利叶 & 布莱恩"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","布莱恩先生，我一直很好奇，你为什么总是戴着眼罩呢？"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412011.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 布莱恩 & 洛桑"],["/interaction_records/7/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","布莱恩先生，天空中正在飞翔的那个影子……是艾洛娜吗？"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412150.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 布莱恩"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","布莱恩的艾洛娜很漂亮哇，她的眼睛像宝石一样单良，羽毛也很润顺！"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413030.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 满满 & 布莱恩"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","与我共饮吧，在这美丽的村落；与我共饮吧，为这宁静的时光……"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413070.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 布莱恩"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","布莱恩，不要递给我那份芜菁豆子汤……"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413110.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 布莱恩"]]}